{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，金融界17名當選人分別是李民橋、梁嘉麗、王祖興、劉鈞、麥永賢、傅劍、鄭建崗、葉子建、陳志輝、謝小玲、陳麗明、施穎茵、陳文、廖宜建、𧝁惠儀、LIM Hui-hung Luanne、黃辛葆璉。<br/>\n<br/>\n財經事務及庫務局前局長陳家強就在該界別分組落選。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.678774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:15:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T21:17:47.020589+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:27.573294+00:00","content_hash":"1ed406fe58d97624dcebc148c2ba3b3cfc487633dffb16562be58c0f7edb6c7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}